Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,little friends! I'm Qiqi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Qiqi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Meets Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi followed a white rabbit in a vest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and jumped down a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,rabbit hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,what a magical place!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What will Qiqi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,find today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi walked down a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,long hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a little table
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,with three things on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A bottle that says —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,'Drink Me.'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And a cake that says
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,— 'Eat Me.'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also a little fan in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the corner, so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.07,0:00:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try a sip first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi picked up the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,bottle and took a sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly — Qiqi started
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.07,0:01:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,shrinking, shrinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,shrinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! I'm so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Only as tall as a teacup!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny Qiqi saw a beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,garden behind a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,little door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go in! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the key is on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't reach it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake will make me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.35,0:01:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,bigger again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi took a big bite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,of the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This time — Qiqi started
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,growing, growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I'm so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is touching
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe, I'm a giant now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.07,0:01:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi was so big,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,she waved her arm — CRASH!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The bookshelf fell over!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The alarm clock flew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:01:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacups rolled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:01:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry! I didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi tried to go through the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but she was too big
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no... I made a mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi was almost in tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She sat down and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.73,0:02:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,thought and thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she noticed a little fan in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the corner of the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When did this get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi picked up the fan and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,gave it a gentle wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Something magical happened — Qiqi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,slowly returned to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,her normal size!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back! Not too big,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,not too small —
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,just right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi unlocked the little door with the key
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and stepped into the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're in a hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,stop and think — the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,might be right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,beside you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Little friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,if you could be big or small,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,what would you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Qiqi in the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,comments!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Qiqi gets lost and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,meets a smiling cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,see you tomorrow! 🌈
